---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import EraCard from "../components/EraCard.astro";

import blossomsLeft from "../assets/board/blossoms-left.png";
import blossomsRight from "../assets/board/blossoms-right.png";
import headerFlower from "../assets/eras/header-flower.png";
import ornament from "../assets/eras/ornament-flower.png";
import blossom from "../assets/eras/blossom.png";

const eras = (await getCollection("eras")).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
// Newest era gets the wide feature card, the next three sit in a row, the rest are the archive.
const [last, ...rest] = eras.filter((era) => era.data.size === "large");
const recent = rest;
const archive = eras.filter((era) => era.data.size === "small");
const archiveRows = [archive.slice(0, 3), archive.slice(3, 6), archive.slice(6, 9)].filter((row) => row.length > 0);
---

<BaseLayout title="Eras | Cal Poly JSA" description="JSA board through the eras: honoring our founders." flushFooter>
  <!-- Banner (79 to 257) -->
  <section class="banner">
    <div class="stage banner__stage">
      <div class="banner__blossoms-right">
        <Image src={blossomsRight} alt="" width={458} height={305} data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 0.3s" />
      </div>
      <Image
        class="banner__blossoms-left"
        src={blossomsLeft}
        alt=""
        width={238}
        height={212}
        data-reveal
        style="--reveal-delay: 0.3s"
      />

      <p class="banner__kicker" data-reveal>
        Our Legacy
      </p>
      <h1 class="banner__title" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 0.1s">
        JSA Board Through the Eras
      </h1>
      <p class="banner__subtitle" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 0.2s">
        Honoring our founders
      </p>

      <span class="banner__rule banner__rule--left" data-reveal="line" style="--reveal-delay: 0.35s"></span>
      <Image
        class="banner__flower"
        src={headerFlower}
        alt=""
        width={45}
        height={45}
        data-reveal
        style="--reveal-delay: 0.3s"
      />
      <span class="banner__rule banner__rule--right" data-reveal="line" style="--reveal-delay: 0.35s"></span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Eras -->
  <section class="eras">
    <div class="eras__drift" aria-hidden="true">
      <Image class="eras__blossom eras__blossom--a" src={blossom} alt="" width={304} height={308} />
      <Image class="eras__blossom eras__blossom--b" src={blossom} alt="" width={304} height={308} />
      <Image class="eras__blossom eras__blossom--c" src={blossom} alt="" width={304} height={308} />
    </div>

    <div class="eras__inner container">
      {last && <EraCard {...last.data} variant="feature" badge="Last era" />}

      <div class="eras__heading" data-reveal="up">
        <span class="eras__jp">近年</span>
        <h2 class="eras__title">Recent eras</h2>
        <div class="eras__divider">
          <span></span>
          <Image src={ornament} alt="" width={34} height={40} />
          <span></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="eras__row">
        {recent.map((era, i) => (
          <EraCard {...era.data} variant="recent" delay={i * 0.12} />
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="eras__heading" data-reveal="up">
        <span class="eras__jp">歴代</span>
        <h2 class="eras__title">Earlier eras</h2>
        <div class="eras__divider">
          <span></span>
          <Image src={ornament} alt="" width={34} height={40} />
          <span></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      {archiveRows.map((row) => (
        <div class="eras__row">
          {row.map((era, i) => (
            <EraCard {...era.data} variant="small" delay={i * 0.1} />
          ))}
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Will Kriss's White Dream reflection -->
  <section class="reflection">
    <div class="stage reflection__stage">
      <h2 class="reflection__name" data-reveal>
        WILL KRISS'S
      </h2>
      <p class="reflection__label reflection__label--highlights" data-reveal>
        HIGHLIGHTS:
      </p>
      <p class="reflection__text reflection__text--highlights" data-reveal>
        The general meetings were definitely my favorite part of the White Dream era. Going through a period of
        transition from small club to big club, the general meetings were the main time we got to interact and entertain
        the majority of JSA. I really like to think that we made our general meetings unique and exciting every week.
        It's hard to narrow it down, but some of my favorite things we did were: rats being thrown at me, laser pointer,
        eating a whole thing of cabbage, T-posing for way too long, and punishment jan-ken-pon. I absolutely loved the
        energy at the meetings and I think that's where we as a board shined the brightest.
      </p>

      <p class="reflection__label reflection__label--advice" data-reveal>
        ADVICE FOR FUTURE JSA:
      </p>
      <p class="reflection__text reflection__text--advice" data-reveal>
        There are two main responsibilities or elements or whatever you want to call it for being on JSA board. The
        first is obviously making stuff happen. You can plan it all out beforehand or learn how to do it on the fly, but
        you have a responsibility to make things actually happen. The second element is creative direction. JSA is
        weird. Not in like a "society doesn't understand me" weird, but a fun, do things out of the box type of way. Be
        creative. Try to do things differently. The worst thing you can be is boring.
      </p>
      <p class="reflection__text reflection__text--passion" data-reveal>
        Now none of this is going to happen without your passion. Find what you're passionate about and find a way to
        bring it into JSA. Keep in mind that what you want to do needs to be for the best of the club, but the club
        won't strive unless you fully believe in what you're doing. If you're passionate about what you're doing for the
        club, it will show and you'll be able to go above and beyond.
      </p>

      <h2 class="reflection__title" data-reveal>
        <span class="reflection__title-line reflection__title-line--white-dream">WHITE DREAM</span>
        <span class="reflection__title-line reflection__title-line--reflection">REFLECTION</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="reflection__love" data-reveal>
        AS ALWAYS love y'all &lt;3 &lt;3 &lt;3
      </p>
      <p class="reflection__sign" data-reveal>
        - Will Kriss
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Everything is positioned against the 1440px design width. */
  .stage {
    position: relative;
    width: var(--page-width);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  /* ---------- Banner (79 to 257) ---------- */
  .banner {
    height: 178px;
    background: var(--color-off-white);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .banner__stage {
    height: 100%;
  }

  /* The right blossoms start 37px above the banner, behind the header. Show only the part below it. */
  .banner__blossoms-right {
    position: absolute;
    left: 838px;
    top: 0;
    width: 458px;
    height: 268px;
    overflow: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .banner__blossoms-right :global(img) {
    width: 458px;
    height: 305px;
    margin-top: -37px;
  }

  .banner__blossoms-left {
    position: absolute;
    left: 138px;
    top: 0;
    width: 238px;
    height: 212px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .banner__kicker,
  .banner__title,
  .banner__subtitle {
    position: absolute;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .banner__kicker {
    left: 634px;
    top: 13px;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: var(--weight-extralight);
    line-height: 42px;
  }

  .banner__title {
    left: 725.5px;
    top: 56.5px;
    translate: -50% 0;
    color: var(--color-salmon);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 43px;
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
    line-height: 43px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .banner__subtitle {
    left: 614px;
    top: 101px;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: var(--weight-extralight);
    line-height: 28px;
  }

  .banner__rule {
    position: absolute;
    top: 151px;
    width: 405px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-line);
  }

  .banner__rule--left {
    left: 230px;
  }

  .banner__rule--right {
    left: 790px;
  }

  .banner__flower {
    position: absolute;
    left: 698px;
    top: 129px;
    width: 45px;
    height: 45px;
  }

  /* ---------- Eras ---------- */
  .eras {
    position: relative;
    padding: 72px 0 96px;
    background: var(--color-peach);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .eras__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .eras__row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .eras__heading {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .eras__jp {
    color: var(--color-red);
    font-family: var(--font-serif-jp);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
  }

  .eras__title {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .eras__divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    width: 300px;
  }

  .eras__divider span {
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: #fbd0cc;
  }

  .eras__divider :global(img) {
    width: 17px;
    height: auto;
  }

  /* Faint blossoms drifting at the page edges, placed against the 1440px design width. */
  .eras__drift {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 0;
    width: var(--page-width);
    height: 100%;
    translate: -50% 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .eras__blossom {
    position: absolute;
    width: 152px;
    height: auto;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .eras__blossom--a {
    left: 1170px;
    top: 420px;
    rotate: -20deg;
  }

  .eras__blossom--b {
    left: -46px;
    top: 1230px;
    rotate: 25deg;
  }

  .eras__blossom--c {
    left: 1190px;
    top: 1980px;
    rotate: 10deg;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .eras__inner {
    position: relative;
  }

  /* ---------- Reflection band (3046.2 to 3596.4) ---------- */
  .reflection {
    margin-top: 3px;
    height: 550.2px;
    background: var(--color-rose);
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .reflection__stage {
    height: 100%;
  }

  .reflection__stage > * {
    position: absolute;
  }

  .reflection__name {
    left: 250px;
    top: 16px;
    width: 391px;
    font-size: 102px;
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    line-height: 71.4px;
  }

  .reflection__label,
  .reflection__text {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: var(--weight-extralight);
    line-height: 20.4px;
  }

  .reflection__label--highlights {
    left: 640px;
    top: 15.7px;
  }

  .reflection__text--highlights {
    left: 640px;
    top: 36.4px;
    width: 529px;
  }

  .reflection__label--advice {
    left: 240px;
    top: 196.9px;
  }

  .reflection__text--advice {
    left: 240px;
    top: 217.6px;
    width: 537px;
  }

  .reflection__text--passion {
    left: 240px;
    top: 360.4px;
    width: 537px;
  }

  .reflection__title {
    left: 785px;
    top: 279.8px;
    width: 415px;
    font-size: 70px;
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    line-height: 49px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .reflection__title-line {
    display: block;
  }

  .reflection__title-line--reflection {
    /* Figma sets this line 1px left of the others. */
    margin-right: 1px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .reflection__love {
    left: 803px;
    top: 440.9px;
    font-family: var(--font-accent);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: var(--weight-light);
    line-height: 20.4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .reflection__sign {
    left: 1113px;
    top: 481.6px;
    width: 68px;
    font-family: var(--font-accent);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: var(--weight-light);
    line-height: 27.2px;
    text-align: right;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
</style>
